{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09246","headline":"路逢崔元二侍御避马见招以诗见赠 · 韦应物","name":"路逢崔元二侍御避马见招以诗见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一台称二妙，归路望行尘。\n俱是攀龙客，空爲避马人。\n见招翻局蹐，相问良殷勤。\n日日吟趋府，弹冠岂有因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}